    <briefdescription>
<para>Inner block definition. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Contains an array of child (inner of leaf) IDs, and array of copies of maximal elements of the corresponding subtrees. Only last child subtree does not have corresponding element copy in this array (but it has a copy of maximal element somewhere in parent&apos;s arrays on in tree struct) </para>    </detaileddescription>
